or）  \n  - `align`（left/center/right）  \n  - `valign`（top/middle/bottom）  \n  - `textwrap`（Automatic line wrapping）  \n  - `border`\n    - `top`：top border（like `[\"thin\",\"#000\"]`）  \n    - `bottom`：bottom border（like `[\"thin\",\"#000\"]`）  \n    - `left`：left border（like `[\"thin\",\"#000\"]`）  \n    - `right`：right border（like `[\"thin\",\"#000\"]`）  \n\n\n---\n\n\n## Dataset rules\nExample：\n```json\n{\n  \"code\": \"a\",\n  \"title\": \"a\",\n  \"isList\": \"1\",\n  \"children\": [\n    { \"title\": \"total_sales\", \"fieldText\": \"total sales\" },\n    { \"title\": \"total_returns\", \"fieldText\": \"Total returned quantity\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n- `code`：Data set variable name  \n- `isList = 1`：gather  \n- `isList = 0`：object  \n- `children`：Field，Contains `title`（Fieldname）、`fieldText`（display name）  \n\n\n---\n\n\n## Rows, columns and filling rules\n- Line number、Column numberfrom0start。  \n- `\"cols\"` Set column width。  \n- **gather (`isList=1`)**：  \n  - oneOKFieldtitle（children.fieldText）  \n  - DownoneOKField占Bitsymbol（`#{code.title}`）  \n- **object (`isList=0`)**：  \n  - EveryFieldAccount for twoList：The left column is the title，The right column is a placeholder `${code.title}`  \n  - Can be arranged horizontally by group  \n\n\n---\n\n\n## merge rules\n- `\"merge\": [Number of vertical merge cells, Number of horizontal merge cells]`  \n  - Number of vertical merge cellsandNumber of horizontal merge cellsyesNot includedwhenforwardoneYuangridofquantity（like Number of vertical merge cells equal1 Just merge one line down；Number of horizontal merge cellsSame reason）\n- Cells covered by the merge do not need to be defined again  \n\n\n---\n\n\n## Special instructions\n- JSON must **pure**：noneComment、none markdown、noneProvinceslightlyNumber。  \n- User-specified styles cannot be changed，Beautification can be done on this basis。\n- unlessusehousehold明确Require，defaultAllrightgenerateofReport做Base美change（likeIncreaseframe、set upfont、set upbackground color）\n- u